  "description": "The raster renderer for DocWright: renders document or PDF pages to PNG or JPEG. No System.Drawing, no SkiaSharp and no native binaries — the rasterizer and both encoders are included. Integer arithmetic throughout, so the same page renders byte-identically across platforms and framework versions. Most users should install the DocWright package instead, which includes this one.",
